a2nAAg1FsPQJPth239qSTAeQUuw8ipoO8Ug_oOBcIKGEltGQv4dKk94zpdfzYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftEJHTYMWc6Jgmq9EdVZkZ_NFhS-DlC9eUahUYIoZ4vnQ&oe=69A5A2BF"}, {"file_name": "s7.png", "id": "723704731946394", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75580066_723704735279727_1657339152001791804_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D3n-SDRf3dAQ7kNvwHvkvi_&_nc_oc=AdlqqsmRL5OsfxC5-T7l_XuDN5rstutjlukYw1l8w5hnQ4geDhMbq5sCCCYeWr657ag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvquY-S3gDKlFdb5FJlW_DWWxeEVrssbMv8j1FJDrcOlQ&oe=69A5700F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-screenshot.png", "id": "342309257413087", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334061_342309264079753_2615715454138737248_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jLjFP7C15vMQ7kNvwF776PQ&_nc_oc=AdnGelfEx-1PZEHHJYbsuKqXklI7QsmbqPS0j6d2nYcH-QvdxIfPETCal09hivVUJ6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftWQ-LM13B4z-F3GnhKkgL7agl8YAo2VQmoIPK16O9YtA&oe=69A59A5A"}, "display_name": "Fake Racing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fake Racing is an indie racing game with an unusual visual style. \n\nFeatures:\n\n- The monochrome pixelized renderer was created specifically for this game. It uses a custom 3D-dithering shading technique to achieve a retro visual style with one of the three available monochrome palettes. \n- Fake car physics. Non-realistic but fun for casual play.\n- Attack from the Air: compete not only against your opponents, but also against the enemy helicopter. This mode creates an extra challenge for the race leaders, making the race more intense. \n- Four tracks with reverse and mirror options. \n\n\nGame modes:\n\n- Attack from the air;\n- Elimination;\n- Classic race. \n", "short_description": "A retro-style indie racing game with a monochrome pixel graphics and a fake car physics. Features Air Attack and Elimination modes. "}]}, "developer_name": n